  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 131e1dca5f7f2ca42be00771cea61f30, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafeStreets.Conversation
  speakerName: Officer Ada
  lines:
  - Welcome to Safe Travelers, recruit! I'm Officer Ada, your town guide.
  - 'Three neighbours need a walking buddy to get across these streets: Granny Rose
    by the grocery, Little Sam by the park path, and Mia down by the library.'
  - Walk up to them, press SPACE to talk, then stay close while you both cross on
    the white stripes.
  - School at the top left, library at the top right, rail crossing on the far west
    edge - and a quiz zone at each spot. Good luck!
  closingTip: Rules from the K-12 Traffic Safety Education Resource Guide
